<title>USA: Anthem clears hurdle for Acordia purchase.</title>
<headline>Anthem clears hurdle for Acordia purchase.</headline>
<dateline>INDANAPOLIS 1997-07-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Anthem Insurance Cos Inc, a mutual insurance company, said Monday it has obtained all necessary approvals from the Indiana Insurance Commissioner in connection with its $40 a share cash tender offer for the shares of Acordia Inc it does not already own.</p>
<p>No other regulatory approvals are necessary, the company said.</p>
<p>In June, Anthem, which holds 66.8 percent of Acordia, said it struck a deal to purchase the rest of the company's shares.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
</text>
